# group Reverse AWB Generation  
## AWB Generation [/v3/clients/orders/generate_awb/]

### Generate AWB [POST]
We have an automated process of sharing new AWBs once the existing ones are about to exhaust. This endpoint is used to generate the AWB numbers. It takes count of AWB Number as parameters.
For any changes, please reach out to Shadowfax's Account Manager.
|||
|------------|-----------|
|Staging|`https://dale.staging.shadowfax.in/api/v3/clients/orders/generate_awb/`|
|Production|`https://dale.shadowfax.in/api/v3/clients/orders/generate_awb/`|

+ Request

    + Body 
    
            { 
                "count" : 10
            }
            
    + Headers
    
            Authorization: Token <token_id here>
            
+ Response 200 (application/json)
    
        {
            "message": "success",
            "awb_numbers": [
                "R82064314",
                "R76634196",
                "R72416059",
                "R71234141",
                "R86383023",
                "R67263848",
                "R59587413",
                "R84059950",
                "R89622149",
                "R49323697"
            ]
        }
+ Response 400 (application/json)
    
        {
            "status": "FAILED",
            "errorCode": "Authentication credentials not provided",
            "message": "Authentication credentials not provided"
        }

# group Order Creation
## Order Creation [/v3/clients/requests]
### Create a Regular Pickup Request[POST]
This endpoint is used to create a new pickup request in our reverse pickup system.
It takes pickup customer specific details, pickup destination details and product attributes details.

Below given are sample pincodes for testing in Staging Environment
*  110009 
*  110001
*  560007

+ Request (application/json)

    + Body
        
            {
                "client_order_number": "0121001",
                "warehouse_name": "Client Warehouse",
                "warehouse_address": "Client Warehouse Address",
                "destination_pincode": 500001,
                "unique_code": "warehouse01",
                "total_amount": 430,
                "price": 412,
                "eway_bill": 123456789012,
                "pickup_type": "regular",
                "address_attributes": {
                    "address_line": "ho no-68,bhati mkt,main dadri road,surajpur",
                    "city": "Noida",
                    "country": "India",
                    "pincode": 201301,
                    "name": "Saurabh Shukla",
                    "phone_number": "9540914499",
                    "alternate_contact": "9999999999",
                    "sms_contact": "9999999999",
                    "latitude" : "12.00000" ,
                    "longitude" : "77.00000",
                    "location_accuracy" : "L" ,
                    "location_type" : "residential"
                },
                "weight_details": {
                    "actual_weight": 2.01,
                    "volumetric_weight": 5.5
                },
                "skus_attributes": [{
                    "name": "Puma-Men-Black-Wirko-Xc-Casual-Shoes (Size: 8)",
                    "client_sku_id": "SC45634",
                    "price": 100,
                    "brand": "Puma",
                    "category": "Shoes",
                    "return_reason": "Size Mismatch",
                    "qc_required": "false",
                    "qc_rules": [{
                        "question": "Is product colour as per description ?",
                        "is_mandatory": 1,
                        "value": "Red"
                    }],
                    "seller_details": {
                        "regd_name": "Seller Name",
                        "regd_address": "GST Regd address",
                        "state": "Karnataka",
                        "gstin": "36AAVCS6697K1Z4"
                    },
                     "taxes": {
                        "cgst_amount": 0.0,
                        "sgst_amount": 0.0,
                        "igst_amount": 18.0,
                        "total_tax_amount": 18.0
                    },
                    "hsn_code": "83294089",
                    "invoice_id": "ADSf",
                    "additional_details": {
                        "color": "black",
                        "size": 8,
                        "sku_images": ["https://sku_image_url/1/","https://sku_image_url/1/"],
                        "quantity_value" : 10,
                        "quantity_unit": "EA"
                    }
                }]
            }
            
    + Attributes
        + Required Parameters (required, object)
            + client_order_number (required, string) - Order number in client's system. Character limit : 100
            + warehouse_address (required, string) - Client warehouse address to which the item will be returned
            + destination_pincode (required, string) - 6 digit valid Pincode. This is the pincode where the picked up product needs to be sent to
            + unique_code (optional, string) - 255 (max length) a unique warehouse code.
            + pickup_type (required, string) - Order Pickup Type. Options: regular, slot and surface
            + total_amount (optional, number) - Total amount (inclusive GST) of the order
            + price (required, number) - Price (exclusive of GST) of the order 
            + eway_bill (required, number) - 12 digit E-way bill. If the total amount is greater than 50,000 then this field is mandatory, otherwise optional. Character limit : 12
            + address_attributes (required, object) - This is the pickup details.
                + address_line(required, string)- Pickup Address
                + city(required, string) - Pickup City.Character limit : 50
                + pincode(required, number) - 6 digit valid pincode of Pickup Address
                + name (required, string) - Pickup Customer's Name. Character limit : 100
                + phone_number (required, string) - Pickup Customer's Contact Number.Character limit :13
                + alternate_contact (optional, string) - Pickup Customer's Alternate Contact Number. If provided, it should. Character limit : 13 be a minimum of 10 digits otherwise validation error will be thrown.
                + sms_contact (optional, string) - Pickup Customer's Contact Number which will be used to send SMS. If provided, it should be a minimum of 10 digits otherwise validation errors will be thrown.
                + latitude (optional, string) - Pickup customers latitude.
                + longitude (optional, string) - Pickup customers longitude.
                + location_accuracy(optional, string) - It should be H,M,L(High, Medium, Low).
                + location_type(optional, string) -  residential or commercial .
            + weight_details (optional, object) - Weight details
                + actual_weight(optional, number) - Weight of the Product (in gms) default :0.0
                + volumetric_weight(optional, number) - Volumetric Weight of the Product (in gms). default : 0.0 (volumetric weight=(l*b*h)/5000)
            + skus_attributes (required, array)
                + (object)   
                    + name(required, string) - Product Name
                    + client_sku_id(optional, string) - Sku Id provided by you (if any). Character limit : 100
                    + price (required, number)  - Price of the Product
                    + category(optional, string) - Product Category. Character limit : 200
                    + brand(optional, string) - Brand name of the Product. Character limit : 200
                    + return_reason(optional,string) - Return reason for product. Character limit : 200
                    + qc_required(optional, string) - Flag to determine if qc is required for the product. Default true.
                    + qc_rules(optional, object) - Customized QC rules for doorstep QC
                        + question (required, string) - Question to be displayed to the pickup boy for QC. Character limit : 255
                        + is_mandatory (required, number) - If QC should fail if this check point is not passed then send 1, else send 0
                        + value (optional, string) - Value of the SKU property which is asked in the question
                    + seller_details (required, object) - Seller details required for GST management.
                        + regd_name (required, string) - Registered name of the seller to which item is to be returned. Character limit : 100
                        + regd_address (required, string) - Registered address of the seller
                        + state (required, string) - State of Registered Address of the seller. Character limit : 50
                        + gstin (required, string) - 15 digit GSTIN of the seller. Character limit : 50
                    + taxes (required, object) - Tax distribution according to GST
                        + cgst_amount (required, number) - CGST Amount
                        + sgst_amount (required, number) - SGST Amount
                        + igst_amount (required, number) - IGST Amount
                        + total_tax_amount (required, number) - Total GST. It is the sum of above three fields
                    + hsn_code (required, string) - 8 digit HSN Code of the item.Character limit : 50
                    + invoice_id (required, string) - Invoice ID. Character limit : 50
                    + additional_details(optional, object) - To help in better doorstep QC, kindly share the following details as well.
                        + color (optional, string) - Product Colour
                        + size (optional, string) - Product Size
                        + imei (optional, string) - IMEI Number of Mobile Phone (Separated by '/' in case of dual sim phones)
                        + sku_images (optional, array) - Array of URL of Sku Images
                        + serial_no (optional, string) - Serial Number of the device
                        + quantity_value (optional, number) - Number of items in SKU
                        + quantity (optional, number) - Number of items in SKU
                        + quantity_unit (optional, number)- Unit value of SKU's
        + Optional Parameters(optional, object)
            + client_request_id (optional, string) - Client Request Id. If it is not provided then we will generate it automatically.
            + warehouse_name (optional, string) - Clients Warehouse Name
    
    

    + Headers
    
            Authorization: Token <token_id here>
        
    

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "message": "Success",
            "client_order_number": "0121001",
            "request_type": "pickup",
