## Bulk Pickup Requests v4 Version [/v4/clients/requests/bulk_query]

###Get Details of Bulk Pickup Requests [POST]

This endpoint is used to get details of multiple pickup requests in one go. The requests are defined by their client request id. The API can be used to track up to 50 AWBs in a single API call. The v4 version of tracking API provides the additional statuses of the reverse flow like Received at Return DC, Undelivered.

+ Request

    + Header
    
            Authorization: Token Authorization
            
    + Body
        
            {
            "request_ids": ["R11507439TST"]
            }
            
    + Attributes
    
            + request_ids (required, array) - Array of AWB numbers for which details are required
            

+ Response 200 (application/json)

