## <a name = "Appendix_On_Hold" > On Hold Remarks </a>

Following are the remarks shared in the cases when the order is marked as `On Hold`.

| Status  | Remarks                            |
|---------|------------------------------------|
| On Hold | Customer want pick-up from Non-Serviceable area                    |
| On Hold | Pincode Address Mismatch           |
| On Hold | Incorrect contact number               |
| On Hold | Address issue           |
| On Hold | Customer wants replacement/refund first        |
| On Hold | Incomplete information received from client      |
| On Hold | Mandatory check not available          |
| On Hold | Pickup already done by other DSP           |
| On Hold | Shipment is not picked           |
| On Hold | Successful 3 attempts done        |
| On Hold | Large Shipment                      |
| On Hold | Customer wants pickup beyond cut off time        |
| On Hold | Customer changed his/her mind |
| On Hold | Doorstep QC Brandbox not available      |
| On Hold | Doorstep QC Price Tag missing        |
| On Hold | Doorstep QC Product Damage       |
| On Hold | Doorstep QC Product Mismatch              |
| On Hold | Doorstep QC Used Item            |
| On Hold | Unable to pickup in given slot                      |
| On Hold | Non Serviceable Area     |
| On Hold | Seller wants pickup beyond cut off time |
| On Hold | COVID Restricted Area      |
| On Hold | Customer does not provide OTP |
| On Hold | Customer is fraud     |
| On Hold | Address is junk     |
| On Hold | Same City Pincode Update     |
| On Hold | InterCity Shipment             |


